Third-party components
----------------------

None. Symbiote has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on 26/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used for the ledger export

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

No model
--------

There is no language model, no endpoint and no key in this app. An answer is assembled from ledger entries
with fixed phrasings, and every line carries the date of the entry it came from. When the ledger has nothing
to cite, the answer says so rather than producing a sentence that sounds like a memory.

That is the whole design: a companion whose memory is a ledger you can read, and whose answers you can check
by reading it.
